<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index rose to 1,419.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index rose to 1,419.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates rose to 1,419 today from 1,414 on March 6, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
<p> Route Index     Rate   Prev Index  Rate</p>
